    "title"            "PZRC Mod"
    "description"      "Standalone server-side toolkit for PZ B42 Multiplayer: starter kit crate, ration fridge, dynamic radio events, library, infinite generator, fuel pump refill, and a welcome note. All logic ships inside the mod — no manual file drops to ~/Zomboid/Lua/ required."

    "changenote"       "0.4.4 — Closed the second context-menu path: ISVehicleMenu.OnFillWorldObjectContextMenu finds the vehicle via direct IsoObjectPicker.Instance:PickVehicle(x, y) bypassing worldobjects, so the 0.4.2 createMenu filter didn't catch it. Now wrapping ISVehicleMenu.FillMenuOutsideVehicle too — third-party mods that hook it (e.g. Vehicle Repair Overhaul's 'Утилизировать транспорт', 10YrsVehicles add-ons) are fully blocked for non-owners, no greyed options, no menu lines, nothing. // 0.4.3 — Deferred wrap installation to OnGameStart for load-order safety. // 0.4.2 — Right-click filter on createMenu. // 0.4.1 — Nested-container fix. // 0.4.0 — Safe-zone vehicle-claim, damage protection, library, FuelPump, abandoned-vehicle event."

